  "../../../host/arm/arcmate/arcmate_base.arm": "# FANUC ARC Mate (A05B-1203-B255) as simulated by arm_sim, without a tool\n# (arcmate.arm adds the welding torch, arcmate_gripper.arm the gripper).\n# EVERY NUMBER IS A GUESS until hwtest/arcmate/RECORD.md has the\n# measured value; the layout is a typical 6-axis welding arm.\n#\n# drives: one stmbl drive per joint (motor parameters in jN.conf)\ndrive 1 j1.conf sim.txt\ndrive 2 j2.conf sim.txt\ndrive 3 j3.conf sim.txt\ndrive 4 j4.conf sim.txt\ndrive 5 j5.conf sim.txt\ndrive 6 j6.conf sim.txt\n#\n# Craig DH (genserkins): J a alpha d theta0  [m, deg]\ndh 1 0     0    0.45 0\ndh 2 0.15 -90   0    -90\ndh 3 0.60  0    0    0\ndh 4 0.12 -90   0.65 0\ndh 5 0     90   0    0\ndh 6 0    -90   0.10 180\n#\n# links: J m cx cy cz Ixx Iyy Izz Ixy Ixz Iyz (about the COM)\nlink 1 40  0     0     -0.10  1.2  1.2  0.8  0 0 0\nlink 2 25  0.30  0     0.05   0.20 1.00 1.00 0 0 0\nlink 3 15  0.05  0.10  0      0.40 0.40 0.15 0 0 0\nlink 4 6   0     0     0.15   0.06 0.06 0.02 0 0 0\nlink 5 3   0     0.03  0      0.01 0.01 0.01 0 0 0\nlink 6 1   0     0     0.04   0.002 0.002 0.002 0 0 0\n#\n# motor: J ratio rotor_j bearing_friction brake [-, kg m^2, Nm, Nm]\nmotor 1 120 0.00035 0.02 8\nmotor 2 120 0.00035 0.02 8\nmotor 3 100 0.00035 0.02 8\nmotor 4 80  0.00003 0.01 1.5\nmotor 5 80  0.00003 0.01 1.5\nmotor 6 50  0.00003 0.01 1.5\n#\n# gear: J stiffness[Nm/rad] damping[Nm s/rad] backlash[arcmin]\ngear 1 2e5 200 1\ngear 2 2e5 200 1\ngear 3 1.5e5 150 1\ngear 4 2e4 20 3\ngear 5 2e4 20 3\ngear 6 1e4 10 3\n#\n# gearbox friction: J fc fs vs fv  [Nm, Nm, rad/s, Nm s/rad]\nfric 1 10 15 0.05 20\nfric 2 12 18 0.05 25\nfric 3 8  12 0.05 15\nfric 4 1  1.5 0.05 1\nfric 5 1  1.5 0.05 1\nfric 6 0.5 0.8 0.05 0.5\n#\n# hard stops [deg]\nlimits 1 -170 170\nlimits 2 -60  90\nlimits 3 -90  160\nlimits 4 -190 190\nlimits 5 -130 130\nlimits 6 -360 360\n#\nhome 0 0 0 0 -90 0\n#\n# geometry (collision prevention, and the plant's contacts): capsules\n# around the links, in each link's frame [m]; GUESSED from the layout\nbody 0 capsule 0 0 0      0 0 0.40     0.16   # pedestal (base)\nbody 1 capsule 0 0 -0.05  0.15 0 0     0.13   # turret\nbody 2 capsule 0 0 0      0.60 0 0     0.09   # upper arm\nbody 3 capsule 0.06 0 0   0.12 0.55 0  0.075  # forearm (to the wrist)\nbody 5 sphere  0 0 0      0.06                # wrist\n# bodies that overlap by construction (two links apart): pedestal and\n# upper arm at the shoulder, forearm and wrist\nselfignore 0 2\nselfignore 3 4\n",
